('factorLeast_spec',['leastOf_spec','candidates_sound','candidate_dominates'],B+f' (a : {rec}), {S}factorLeast K L R = some a ↔ {S}valid K L R a ∧ ∀ b, {S}valid K L R b → a ≤ b','Forward: leastOf candidate min is valid; any valid b is bounded below by a candidate c, so a≤c≤b. Reverse: choose a candidate c≤a from candidate_dominates; validity and global minimality give a≤c, hence equality and a is a candidate, then leastOf_spec. The full preimage is only a semantic predicate, never enumerated in factorLeast.'),
