('domain_membership',['record_eta'],f'∀ (κ σ τ : Type) (K : Finset κ) (S : Finset σ) (T : Finset τ) (a : {rec}), a ∈ {dom} ↔ {S}outer a ∈ K ∧ {S}left a ∈ S ∧ {S}right a ∈ T','Unfold domain and use biUnion/image/product membership. In the reverse direction choose the actual two coordinates and record_eta. This domain enumerates action records for selection, permitted by the original source; factorLeast never calls it.'),
